## Development

<!-- PHP_DEV_START -->
Install Node dependencies once to activate the git hooks (managed by
[husky](https://github.com/typicode/husky) + [lint-staged](https://github.com/lint-staged/lint-staged)):

```bash
npm install
```

This wires up a `pre-commit` hook that runs PHPCS on staged PHP files and
PHPStan against the whole project.

